<title>THAILAND: Japanese tourist found dead on Thai expressway.</title>
<headline>Japanese tourist found dead on Thai expressway.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai police said on Wednesday they had found the stabbed and badly bruised body of a female Japanese tourist on an uncompleted expressway on the outskirts of Bangkok.</p>
<p>Police told Reuters they had identified the victim as Masako Welker, in her 40s, from documents found on her body.</p>
<p>She had been stabbed in the chest and police said they believed she had been thrown from a car.</p>
<p>They said they were investigating.</p>
